  "releaseNotes": "Adds the read-only adr-guard doctor command for local environment diagnostics.\nIntegrates deterministic architectural drift verification with the GitHub Action while preserving CLI schemas, exit codes, and human-owned approval.\nIncludes developer-experience, onboarding, maintainability, security, reliability, and test improvements from the Phase 1 and Phase 2 work.\nFull release notes: https://github.com/rodri-oliveira-dev/adr-guard/releases/tag/v1.10.0",
